  "description": "An ordinary college student, \"Ye-Seul\", starts a part-time job at a broadcasting station cafe to meet \"Min-Jun\", the youngest main news announcer in South Korea, who is also known as a spy. Contrary to her expectations, Kim Min-Jun is a very cold person... \n\n\"Do you know how long I've liked you? Why are you being so cold towards me?\"\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
